    "blurb": "Efficient REST API Intermediate Polling",
    "overview": "Empower your Camunda workflows with the REST API Polling Connector. Keep tabs on external system changes by polling REST APIs and triggering intermediate events based on custom conditions. Perfect for when you're dealing with systems that don't support webhooks",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Activate Dynamic Polling for REST APIs in Your Camunda Processes",
    "splashDescription": "When external systems lack webhook support and you need to track status changes, the REST API Polling Connector becomes your listening ear. It's specially designed for Camunda processes to periodically poll REST APIs and trigger intermediate events based on custom conditions and HTTP configurations. Whether it's checking for ticket updates in a support system or monitoring changes in order data, this Connector ensures your processes stay up-to-date and reactive to changes outside of Camunda.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/422918/overview/img5525889511705093312.png?aaceda119f93e184bc31db88a619f39e",
